  "body": "The situation improved for this particular image and for other photos of these puppies. However, I now think we have two problems.\n\nI have two near-identical RAW files where ART, even with your fix, deduces significantly different curves. These are two consecutive frames in a burst. I would say that DSCN0107 is mishandled, while DSCN0108 is correct. The out-of-camera JPEGs, also included in the shared folder below, are almost identical.\n\nUnfortunately, GitHub does not allow me to add new attachments to this issue, so please grab them from my PCloud:\n\nhttps://u.pcloud.link/publink/show?code=kZX0jK5ZWrbGU8q1Gj0wkA8wjvYtousFPfzX\n\nThese pictures are also CC0-licensed.",
